WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.800
If you want to be a true reborn Christian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.520
you need to follow Jesus Christ.
Because He is the truth, the Word of God.&nbsp;

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.560
John 1:1: In the beginning was the&nbsp;
Word, and the Word was with God.&nbsp;

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.680
And the Word was God.
If you follow Him - if you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:27.080
truly love Jesus Christ with everything&nbsp;
that is in you - you will obey His Word.&nbsp;

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:36.480
John 14:15 says if you love Me,&nbsp;
you will keep My commandments.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.720
Please listen to me today.
You cannot just follow certain parts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:44.120
of scripture, certain parts of the Bible that&nbsp;
fit in with your lifestyle and leave the rest.&nbsp;

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:48.760
You either commit to God fully and change&nbsp;
your lifestyle according to scripture,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:54.000
or you're deceiving yourself and you're a lukewarm&nbsp;
Christian, which means you're a fake Christian.

